{"id": "eaf20269-c036-438d-94d0-414ddbfd16ba", "slug": "aurelia-haute-couture-maison", "title": "AURELIA — Haute Couture Maison", "description": "Aurelia Haute Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"AURELIA — Haute Couture Maison\"\ndescription: \"Aurelia Haute Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#C9967E\"\n  secondary: \"#FAF5EF\"\n  accent: \"#E8D5B7\"\n  background: \"#06050A\"\n  surface: \"#E8D5B7\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Cormorant Garamond\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AURELIA — Haute Couture Maison\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 208; favorites: 12; remixes: 1.\nTags: hero, section, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nAurelia Haute Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nAurelia Collections Atelier Heritage Journal Book Appointment Printemps / Été 2026 The Art of Woven Light Where couture meets the ephemeral. Each thread traces a lineage of craft — silk spun in Lyon, cut in our Parisian…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The Art of Woven Light.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #C9967E, secondary #FAF5EF, accent #E8D5B7, background #06050A, surface #E8D5B7, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Cormorant Garamond for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AURELIA — Haute Couture Maison</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300&family=Inter:wght@200;300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind & Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#06050a] text-[#faf5ef] font-['Inter',sans-serif] font-light overflow-hidden antialiased h-screen w-screen relative selection:bg-[#c9967e]/30\">\n\n    <!-- Noise Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[9999] opacity-[0.035]\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;); background-size: 128px 128px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Container -->\n    <section class=\"relative w-full h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- WebGL Background -->\n        <canvas id=\"heroCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Gradient Lighting Overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[1] pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 50%, rgba(6,5,10,0.35) 0%, transparent 70%), radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 30% 40%, rgba(201,150,126,0.04) 0%, transparent 70%), radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 50% at 70% 60%, rgba(212,160,160,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%), linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 60%, #06050a 100%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation -->\n        <nav class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between px-6 md:px-12 py-6 backdrop-blur-md bg-[#06050a]/20 border-b border-[#c9967e]/10\">\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"nav-logo font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] font-extralight text-xl tracking-tight uppercase text-[#faf5ef]\">\n                <span class=\"font-normal bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e8d5b7] to-[#c9967e]\">Aurelia</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Links -->\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex gap-9 items-center\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45 hover:text-[#faf5ef] transition-colors duration-300\">Collections</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45 hover:text-[#faf5ef] transition-colors duration-300\">Atelier</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45 hover:text-[#faf5ef] transition-colors duration-300\">Heritage</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45 hover:text-[#faf5ef] transition-colors duration-300\">Journal</a>\n\n                <!-- Nav CTA -->\n                <button class=\"nav-cta relative overflow-hidden text-xs tracking-[0.12em] uppercase px-7 py-2.5 border border-[#c9967e]/25 text-[#e8d5b7] transition-all duration-500 hover:border-[#c9967e]/50 group\">\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10\">Book Appointment</span>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#c9967e]/10 to-[#e8d5b7]/10 -translate-x-full group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out z-0\"></div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Hero Content -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6 md:px-12\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(6,5,10,0.8), 0 0 40px rgba(6,5,10,0.5);\">\n\n            <!-- Eyebrow -->\n            <div class=\"hero-eyebrow flex items-center gap-4 mb-6 opacity-80\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-[#c9967e]\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.32em] uppercase text-[#c9967e]\">Printemps / Été 2026</span>\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-[#c9967e]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Title -->\n            <h1 class=\"hero-title font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] font-extralight text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-7 text-[#faf5ef]\">\n                The Art of<br>\n                <em class=\"not-italic italic font-extralight bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e8d5b7] via-[#c9967e] to-[#d4a0a0]\">Woven Light</em>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subtitle -->\n            <p class=\"hero-sub text-sm font-extralight leading-relaxed text-[#faf5ef]/60 max-w-md mb-10 tracking-wide\">\n                Where couture meets the ephemeral. Each thread traces a lineage of craft — silk spun in Lyon, cut in our Parisian atelier, shaped by hands that understand the poetry of drape.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Actions -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-center\">\n                <!-- Primary Button -->\n                <button class=\"hero-btn relative overflow-hidden flex items-center gap-3 font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-xs uppercase px-11 py-4 text-[#06050a] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e8d5b7] to-[#c9967e] transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-[1px] group\">\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 tracking-[0.18em]\">Explore the Collection</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"relative z-10 -translate-x-1 group-hover:translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <div class=\"shimmer-bg absolute inset-[-2px] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e8d5b7] via-[#c9967e] to-[#d4a0a0] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-50 blur-md transition-opacity duration-500 -z-10\" style=\"background-size: 300% 300%;\"></div>\n                </button>\n\n                <!-- Ghost Button -->\n                <button class=\"hero-btn flex items-center gap-3 font-['Inter',sans-serif] text-xs uppercase px-9 py-4 border border-[#e8d5b7]/20 text-[#e8d5b7] transition-all duration-500 hover:border-[#e8d5b7]/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(201,150,126,0.1)] group\">\n                    <span class=\"tracking-[0.18em]\">View Lookbook</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:book-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Badges -->\n            <div class=\"flex gap-8 md:gap-12 mt-14\">\n                <div class=\"hero-badge flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <span class=\"font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-[#e8d5b7] tracking-tight\">1847</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45\">Est. Paris</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-badge flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <span class=\"font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-[#e8d5b7] tracking-tight\">17</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45\">Master Artisans</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-badge flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\">\n                    <span class=\"font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-[#e8d5b7] tracking-tight\">IV</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.16em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45\">Generations</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Scroll Hint -->\n        <div class=\"scroll-hint absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#faf5ef]/45\">Scroll</span>\n            <div class=\"scroll-line w-[1px] h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#c9967e] to-transparent origin-top\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Animation & WebGL Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // Intro Animations & Continuous Loops\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            // Elements to animate in on load\n            const elementsToAnimate = [\n                { selector: '.nav-logo', transform: 'translateY(-20px)', delay: 100 },\n                { selector: '.nav-link', transform: 'translateY(-20px)', delay: 200, stagger: 100 },\n                { selector: '.nav-cta', transform: 'translateX(20px)', delay: 600 },\n                { selector: '.hero-eyebrow', transform: 'translateY(20px)', delay: 800 },\n                { selector: '.hero-title', transform: 'translateY(30px) scale(0.98)', delay: 1000 },\n                { selector: '.hero-sub', transform: 'translateY(20px)', delay: 1200 },\n                { selector: '.hero-btn', transform: 'translateY(20px)', delay: 1400, stagger: 100 },\n                { selector: '.hero-badge', transform: 'translateY(20px)', delay: 1600, stagger: 150 },\n                { selector: '.scroll-hint', transform: 'translateY(-20px)', delay: 2200 }\n            ];\n\n            elementsToAnimate.forEach(config => {\n                const els = document.querySelectorAll(config.selector);\n                els.forEach((el, index) => {\n                    el.style.transform = config.transform;\n                    el.style.opacity = '0';\n                    requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n                        el.style.transition = 'all 1.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)';\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            el.style.transform = 'translate(0) scale(1)';\n                            el.style.opacity = '1';\n                        }, config.delay + (config.stagger ? index * config.stagger : 0));\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Continuous animation loops (replaces CSS keyframes)\n            let startTime = performance.now();\n            const shimmerBg = document.querySelector('.shimmer-bg');\n            const scrollLine = document.querySelector('.scroll-line');\n\n            function animationLoop(time) {\n                const elapsed = time - startTime;\n\n                // Shimmer loop (4s)\n                if (shimmerBg) {\n                    const shimmerPhase = (elapsed % 4000) / 4000;\n                    const pos = shimmerPhase < 0.5 ? shimmerPhase * 200 : (1 - shimmerPhase) * 200;\n                    shimmerBg.style.backgroundPosition = `${pos}% 50%`;\n                }\n\n                // Scroll pulse loop (2s)\n                if (scrollLine) {\n                    const scrollPhase = (elapsed % 2000) / 2000;\n                    const sineVal = Math.sin(scrollPhase * Math.PI * 2) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                    scrollLine.style.opacity = (0.3 + sineVal * 0.5).toString();\n                    scrollLine.style.transform = `scaleY(${0.6 + sineVal * 0.4})`;\n                }\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animationLoop);\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(animationLoop);\n        });\n\n        // WebGL Ambient Background Rendering\n        (function() {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('heroCanvas');\n            const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: true, antialias: false, premultipliedAlpha: false });\n            if (!gl) return;\n\n            let mx = 0.5, my = 0.5, tmx = 0.5, tmy = 0.5;\n\n            function resize() {\n                const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 1.5);\n                const W = canvas.parentElement.clientWidth;\n                const H = canvas.parentElement.clientHeight;\n                canvas.width = W * dpr;\n                canvas.height = H * dpr;\n                canvas.style.width = W + 'px';\n                canvas.style.height = H + 'px';\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            }\n\n            const VERT = `attribute vec2 p;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(p,0,1);}`;\n            const FRAG = `\n            precision highp float;\n            uniform float u_t;\n            uniform vec2 u_r;\n            uniform vec2 u_m;\n\n            float hash(vec2 p) {\n              vec3 p3 = fract(vec3(p.xyx) * 0.1031);\n              p3 += dot(p3, p3.yzx + 33.33);\n              return fract((p3.x + p3.y) * p3.z);\n            }\n\n            float noise(vec2 p) {\n              vec2 i = floor(p);\n              vec2 f = fract(p);\n              f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n              float a = hash(i);\n              float b = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0));\n              float c = hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0));\n              float d = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0));\n              return mix(mix(a, b, f.x), mix(c, d, f.x), f.y);\n            }\n\n            float fbm(vec2 p) {\n              float v = 0.0, a = 0.5;\n              mat2 rot = mat2(0.8, 0.6, -0.6, 0.8);\n              for(int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n                v += a * noise(p);\n                p = rot * p * 2.1;\n                a *= 0.45;\n              }\n              return v;\n            }\n\n            vec2 curlNoise(vec2 p) {\n              float eps = 0.5;\n              float n1 = fbm(p + vec2(0.0, eps));\n              float n2 = fbm(p - vec2(0.0, eps));\n              float n3 = fbm(p + vec2(eps, 0.0));\n              float n4 = fbm(p - vec2(eps, 0.0));\n              return vec2((n1 - n2), -(n3 - n4)) / (2.0 * eps);\n            }\n\n            float ribbon(vec2 uv, float yPos, float freq, float amp, float phase, float width, float speed, float t, vec2 mouse) {\n              vec2 curlP = uv * 1.8 + vec2(t * speed * 0.1, phase);\n              vec2 curl = curlNoise(curlP) * 0.5;\n              vec2 toMouse = mouse - uv;\n              float mDist = length(toMouse);\n              float mInfluence = smoothstep(0.20, 0.0, mDist) * 0.05;\n              vec2 mDeflect = vec2(-toMouse.y, toMouse.x) * mInfluence;\n              mDeflect += toMouse * mInfluence * 0.1;\n              vec2 displacedUV = uv + curl + mDeflect;\n              float warp = fbm(vec2(displacedUV.x * 2.0 + phase, t * speed * 0.15 + phase * 0.7)) * 0.3;\n              float ribbonY = yPos + amp * sin(displacedUV.x * freq + t * speed * 0.3 + warp + phase);\n              float warp2 = noise(vec2(displacedUV.x * 3.5 + phase * 2.0, t * speed * 0.2)) * 0.15;\n              ribbonY += amp * 0.4 * sin(displacedUV.x * freq * 1.7 + t * speed * 0.4 + warp2 + phase * 1.5);\n              float d = abs(displacedUV.y - ribbonY);\n              float shape = smoothstep(width, width * 0.05, d);\n              float core = exp(-d * d / (width * width * 0.06)) * 0.9;\n              float edge = smoothstep(width * 1.1, width * 0.85, d) * smoothstep(width * 0.5, width * 0.85, d) * 0.5;\n              return shape * 0.7 + core + edge;\n            }\n\n            void main() {\n              vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_r;\n              float aspect = u_r.x / u_r.y;\n              vec2 uvA = vec2(uv.x * aspect, uv.y);\n              vec2 mouseA = vec2(u_m.x * aspect, u_m.y);\n              float t = u_t;\n\n              vec3 roseGold  = vec3(0.79, 0.59, 0.49);\n              vec3 champagne = vec3(0.91, 0.84, 0.72);\n              vec3 cream     = vec3(0.98, 0.96, 0.93);\n              vec3 rose      = vec3(0.83, 0.63, 0.63);\n              vec3 warmWhite = vec3(1.0, 0.97, 0.92);\n              vec3 deepRose  = vec3(0.65, 0.42, 0.38);\n\n              vec3 col = vec3(0.0);\n              float totalAlpha = 0.0;\n\n              float r1;\n              r1 = ribbon(uvA, 0.18, 3.5, 0.14, 0.0, 0.055, 0.05, t, mouseA); col += deepRose * 0.55 * r1; totalAlpha += r1 * 0.4;\n              r1 = ribbon(uvA, 0.42, 3.0, 0.16, 2.1, 0.060, 0.045, t, mouseA); col += rose * 0.45 * r1; totalAlpha += r1 * 0.35;\n              r1 = ribbon(uvA, 0.72, 2.8, 0.12, 4.2, 0.052, 0.055, t, mouseA); col += deepRose * 0.50 * r1; totalAlpha += r1 * 0.38;\n              r1 = ribbon(uvA, 0.88, 3.2, 0.10, 5.5, 0.048, 0.04, t, mouseA); col += rose * 0.40 * r1; totalAlpha += r1 * 0.3;\n\n              float r2;\n              r2 = ribbon(uvA, 0.25, 5.0, 0.12, 1.0, 0.035, 0.08, t, mouseA); col += roseGold * 0.70 * r2; totalAlpha += r2 * 0.55;\n              r2 = ribbon(uvA, 0.48, 4.5, 0.14, 3.3, 0.038, 0.07, t, mouseA); col += champagne * 0.65 * r2; totalAlpha += r2 * 0.50;\n              r2 = ribbon(uvA, 0.62, 5.5, 0.11, 5.0, 0.032, 0.08, t, mouseA); col += roseGold * 0.68 * r2; totalAlpha += r2 * 0.52;\n              r2 = ribbon(uvA, 0.80, 4.2, 0.13, 7.1, 0.036, 0.065, t, mouseA); col += champagne * 0.60 * r2; totalAlpha += r2 * 0.48;\n              r2 = ribbon(uvA, 0.35, 4.8, 0.10, 8.5, 0.030, 0.09, t, mouseA); col += rose * 0.58 * r2; totalAlpha += r2 * 0.46;\n\n              float r3;\n              r3 = ribbon(uvA, 0.30, 7.0, 0.08, 0.5, 0.018, 0.11, t, mouseA); col += warmWhite * 0.75 * r3; totalAlpha += r3 * 0.6;\n              r3 = ribbon(uvA, 0.52, 6.5, 0.09, 2.7, 0.020, 0.10, t, mouseA); col += cream * 0.70 * r3; totalAlpha += r3 * 0.58;\n              r3 = ribbon(uvA, 0.70, 7.5, 0.07, 4.9, 0.016, 0.12, t, mouseA); col += warmWhite * 0.72 * r3; totalAlpha += r3 * 0.56;\n              r3 = ribbon(uvA, 0.15, 8.0, 0.06, 6.3, 0.014, 0.10, t, mouseA); col += champagne * 0.68 * r3; totalAlpha += r3 * 0.52;\n              r3 = ribbon(uvA, 0.90, 6.8, 0.07, 8.0, 0.017, 0.09, t, mouseA); col += cream * 0.65 * r3; totalAlpha += r3 * 0.50;\n\n              float glow = smoothstep(0.85, 0.0, length(uv - vec2(0.5, 0.45))) * 0.06;\n              col += roseGold * glow; totalAlpha += glow;\n              float glow2 = smoothstep(0.7, 0.0, length(uv - vec2(0.35, 0.55))) * 0.03;\n              col += rose * glow2; totalAlpha += glow2;\n              float mGlow = smoothstep(0.20, 0.0, length(uv - u_m)) * 0.03;\n              col += champagne * mGlow; totalAlpha += mGlow;\n\n              float vig = smoothstep(0.0, 0.65, length(uv - 0.5));\n              col *= 1.0 - vig * 0.45;\n              totalAlpha *= 1.0 - vig * 0.35;\n\n              totalAlpha = clamp(totalAlpha, 0.0, 1.0);\n              col = clamp(col, 0.0, 1.0);\n\n              gl_FragColor = vec4(col, totalAlpha);\n            }\n            `;\n\n            function compile(type, src) {\n                const s = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s, src);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                return s;\n            }\n\n            const prog = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, VERT));\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, FRAG));\n            gl.linkProgram(prog);\n            gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n            const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new F